meta {
  name: Health check
  type: http
  seq: 1
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}{{apiPrefix}}/health
  body: none
  auth: none
}

docs {
  Liveness plus a real `SELECT 1`, which is the point: this is also the daily
  keep-alive that stops Supabase's free tier pausing the database for inactivity.
  `vercel.json` runs it on a cron at 06:00 UTC.

  - 200 `{"status": "ok", "env": "...", "db": "ok"}`
  - 200 without the `db` field when DATABASE_URL is unset (CI, a bare checkout)
  - 503 database configured but unreachable
}
